id: rook
name: Rook
order: 3
optionOf: pieces-of-the-hive
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1/2 (rounded up) of the Apparel Bonus for your Insect Shell.
text: >
  Rook [Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1/2 (rounded up) of the Apparel Bonus for your Insect Shell.

---

[passive]
wound += ceil(naturalArmor.apparelBonus / 2);
soakValue += ceil(naturalArmor.apparelBonus / 2);
